      "content": "i get that but it doesn't change the reality. everything i do just makes things harder for them. my partner is constantly stressed, my kid is seeing me like this... it's like i'm just an anchor dragging everyone down into the mud. if i wasn't here, life would actually be easier for them. they could finally just breathe.",
